1. Free use (development)
   You may install, use, modify, and self-host this package free of charge in
   non-production environments (e.g. local and CI/testing) for the purpose of
   evaluation and development.

2. Premium features (production / staging)
   Certain features are reserved for holders of a valid paid license. On
   production and staging environments these features are gated and require
   activation with a license serial obtained from the author:
     - the full list of accepted coins on the checkout page;
     - the withdrawal and top-up actions in the admin panel;
     - the transaction and withdrawal detail views.
   The remaining functionality continues to work without a license.

3. Restrictions
   You may not remove, disable, or circumvent the licensing mechanism in order
   to use the premium features in production/staging without a valid license,
   nor redistribute license serials.

